# The MapExits with bPlayTransition (20 in the campaign), fired as their owners fire them: `CauseEvent <tag>` is `A.Trigger(Self, Self)` on every actor with that tag
# (Engine/PlayerPawn.uc:1286, cheats on). The player rides the camera path in the Interpolating state (Physics 8) and InterpolateEnd sends it to the next map.
# The ride is sampled in slow motion (`set LevelInfo TimeDilation 0.1`: a sample costs a few seconds of wall time, a tenth of that in level time): f1..f40 are the player's place
# and LevelTime while the Island's path runs, g1..g40 the same for 04_NYC_BatteryPark, whose two MapExits share the tag Mission4Exit (both fire on one CauseEvent).
# Run: scripts/travel-probe.sh tr-f @scripts/travel-steps/tr-f-camera-paths.steps
cmd:set DeusEx.JCDentonMale bCheatsEnabled True
cmd:set LevelInfo bPlayersOnly True
cmd:LocalTravel 01_NYC_UNATCOIsland
arrive:01_nyc_unatcoisland$
cmd:set LevelInfo bPlayersOnly True
props:JCDentonMale:f0:Location:0x114:f3,Physics:0x30:u8,LevelTime:0xa8:pf:0x478
cmd:set LevelInfo TimeDilation 0.1
cmd:CauseEvent Dock_boat
